WIRE.md §6.8: the same #define name redefined with a different value is E7102.
-- call --
load.defines("data/a.h")
-- type --
defines
-- data/a.h --
#define X 1
#define X 2
-- findings.txt --
error[E7102]  data/a.h:2:1
  X redefined with a different value (2, first 1 at data/a.h:1)

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
